abstract: >-
  Scientific Ontology Public Edition v2.2.0 is a public-facing conceptual
  archive for Existence-Boundary Theory / Scientific Ontology. This release
  adds an Applications layer, develops public personality AI documents around
  response structure and return dynamics, reorganizes AI-related Research
  Notes, and clarifies the project's methodological position on science as a
  heuristic system. It is not an empirical scientific theory, implementation
  specification, or disclosure of private core materials.
